# Local LLM Knowledge Base (DO NOT COMMIT TO GIT)
# This is Ollama/AnythingLLM's local memory database
# - Contains indexed documents, embeddings, and vector stores
# - Size: ~100+ MB (varies based on loaded models)
# - User-specific: Not version controlled
_KNOWLEDGE_BASE/
_KNOWLEDGE_BASE/.env_*
_KNOWLEDGE_BASE/env_*
_KNOWLEDGE_BASE/config/.env_*

# Sync .project/sourceTexts/ folder (source text files)

